READ THIS AS: a combination whose ratio exceeds 1 is held at its DETUNED value by the
prior, in BOTH arms, for a reason unrelated to the projection. If that list is not
empty, set param_prior=False in the _SHARED block of gantry_interconnect_dynamic.py
(or lower param_rmse_baseline until it is) before launching the pair. The choice is
recorded as PARAM_PRIOR in config.json either way (D-193).

